<!-- ── FORECAST INPUTS ── -->
<section class="mb-14" aria-labelledby="lbl-inputs">
<div class="section-hdr">
<span class="section-lbl" id="lbl-inputs">Forecast & Intraday Inputs</span>
<div class="section-line"></div>
</div>
<div class="inputs-5">
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Daily Forecast
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0" aria-label="Daily Forecast help">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Daily Forecast</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">What it means</div>
<div class="tt-body">Total expected contact volume for the day produced by the WFM planning system before operations begin.</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">Baseline for all reforecast calculations. Higher accuracy = better staffing decisions.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<input class="inp" id="daily-forecast" type="number" value="2200" min="0">
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Actual Calls (So Far)
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Actual Calls Received</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">What it means</div>
<div class="tt-body">Real-time count of contacts received from start of day to the current interval.</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">Sum of all interval actuals to now</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">Compare against expected to detect early over/under-delivery of volume.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<input class="inp" id="actual-calls" type="number" value="1340" min="0">
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Hist. Completion % (by now)
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Historical Completion %</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">What it means</div>
<div class="tt-body">Percentage of daily volume typically received by the current time of day, based on historical patterns.</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">Hist% = Calls to now / Total day × 100</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">Typical range 40–70% depending on time of day. Used to derive expected calls.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<input class="inp" id="hist-completion" type="number" value="60" min="1" max="100">
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Current Interval</div>
<input class="inp" id="current-interval" type="text" value="13:00">
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Interval Length (min)
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Interval Length for Capacity</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">Calls/Agent = Interval Secs / AHT</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">Used in capacity simulation. Typically 15 or 30 min.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<input class="inp" id="interval-len" type="number" value="30" min="5">
</div>
</div>
