<!-- ── KPI ROW ── -->
<section class="mb-20" id="kpi-row" style="display:none" aria-labelledby="lbl-kpi" aria-live="polite">
<div class="section-hdr">
<span class="section-lbl" id="lbl-kpi">Live Intelligence Metrics</span>
<div class="section-line"></div>
</div>
<div class="kpi-5">
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Forecast Bias
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Forecast Bias %</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">What it means</div>
<div class="tt-body">How far the forecast deviates from actual demand. Positive = under-forecast; Negative = over-forecast.</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">Bias% = (Actual − Forecast) / Forecast × 100</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">0–5%: Accurate | 5–10%: Moderate | &gt;10%: High Bias</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<div class="kpi-val" id="kpi-bias">—</div>
<div id="bias-badge" class="kpi-sub">—</div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Reforecast EOD
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Reforecast End-of-Day</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">Corrected = Forecast × (Actual / Expected)</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">Values above original forecast signal higher demand. Use for real-time staffing decisions.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<div class="kpi-val c-cyan" id="kpi-reforecast">—</div>
<div class="kpi-sub">Corrected Volume</div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Variance %
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Intraday Variance %</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">Variance% = (Actual − Expected) / Expected × 100</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">Positive = higher than expected. Values beyond ±10% warrant attention.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<div class="kpi-val" id="kpi-variance">—</div>
<div class="kpi-sub" id="kpi-variance-sub">—</div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Demand Variability
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Historical Variability Index (CV)</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">CV = Std Dev / Mean × 100</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">&lt;10%: Stable | 10–20%: Moderate | &gt;20%: High Variability</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<div class="kpi-val" id="kpi-cv">—</div>
<div id="cv-badge" class="kpi-sub">—</div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Capacity Risk
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Capacity Risk Level</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">Remaining = Corrected FC − Actual<br>Utilization = Remaining / Capacity × 100</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">≤90%: Safe | 90–110%: Moderate | &gt;110%: Critical</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<div id="kpi-risk-label" class="risk-lbl" style="margin-top:6px">—</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ── ANALYSIS SECTION ── -->
<section class="mb-20" id="analysis-section" style="display:none" aria-labelledby="lbl-analysis">
<div class="section-hdr">
<span class="section-lbl" id="lbl-analysis">Intraday Analysis</span>
<div class="section-line"></div>
</div>
<div class="g-3">
<!-- Reforecast -->
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Reforecast Engine
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Intraday Reforecast Engine</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">Expected = Forecast × Hist%<br>Corrected = Forecast × (Actual / Expected)<br>Variance% = (Actual − Expected) / Expected × 100</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">Corrected above original = higher demand. Escalate staffing.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<div class="metric-row"><span class="mr-lbl">Daily Forecast</span><span class="mr-val" id="rf-daily">—</span></div>
<div class="metric-row"><span class="mr-lbl">Expected (by now)</span><span class="mr-val" id="rf-expected">—</span></div>
<div class="metric-row"><span class="mr-lbl">Actual (so far)</span><span class="mr-val c-green" id="rf-actual">—</span></div>
<div class="metric-row"><span class="mr-lbl">Variance %</span><span class="mr-val" id="rf-variance">—</span></div>
<div class="metric-row"><span class="mr-lbl">Corrected EOD</span><span class="mr-val c-cyan" id="rf-corrected">—</span></div>
</div>
