<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Arrival Pattern
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Traffic Pattern Classification</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Patterns</div>
<div class="tt-body">Normal | Front-Loaded | Delayed Arrival | Midday Spike | Evening Surge | Double Peak</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">Use to adjust shift timing, break scheduling, and interval-level staffing.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<div class="pattern-center">
<div class="pattern-icon-big" id="pattern-icon">📊</div>
<div class="pattern-name-big" id="pattern-name">—</div>
<div class="pattern-desc-txt" id="pattern-desc">Run analysis to detect pattern</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Spike Detection -->
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title">Spike Detection
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Spike Detection Engine</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">Deviation% = (Actual − Hist Avg) / Hist Avg × 100</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">&lt;5%: Normal | 5–10%: Mild | 10–15%: Major | &gt;15%: Critical</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<div class="metric-row"><span class="mr-lbl">Historical Average</span><span class="mr-val" id="spike-hist-avg">—</span></div>
<div class="metric-row"><span class="mr-lbl">Today's Volume</span><span class="mr-val c-cyan" id="spike-today">—</span></div>
<div class="metric-row"><span class="mr-lbl">Deviation %</span><span class="mr-val" id="spike-dev">—</span></div>
<div class="metric-row"><span class="mr-lbl">Severity</span><span id="spike-badge">—</span></div>
<div class="metric-row"><span class="mr-lbl">Direction</span><span class="mr-val" id="spike-drift">—</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ── CAPACITY RISK SIMULATOR ── -->
<section class="mb-20" aria-labelledby="lbl-capacity">
<div class="section-hdr">
<span class="section-lbl" id="lbl-capacity">Capacity Risk Simulator</span>
<div class="section-line"></div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="cap-inputs mb-14">
<div>
<div class="inp-lbl">Available Agents
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Available Agents</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">What it means</div>
<div class="tt-body">Total agents scheduled for the current interval. Shrinkage is applied to derive effective count.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<input class="inp" id="agents" type="number" value="45" min="0">
</div>
<div>
<div class="inp-lbl">FuRT/AHT (seconds)
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Average Handle Time</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">AHT = Talk + Hold + Wrap-up</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">Typical: 180–420s. Drives per-agent capacity calculation.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<input class="inp" id="aht" type="number" value="280" min="1">
</div>
<div>
<div class="inp-lbl">Shrinkage %
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt">
<div class="tt-title">Shrinkage %</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Formula</div>
<div class="tt-formula">Effective = Agents × (1 − Shrinkage/100)</div>
<div class="tt-lbl">Interpretation</div>
<div class="tt-body">Industry avg: 25–35%. Includes breaks, training, aux.</div>
</div>
</span>
</div>
<input class="inp" id="shrinkage" type="number" value="30" min="0" max="99">
</div>
<div>
<div class="inp-lbl">Interval Length (min)</div>
<input class="inp" id="interval-len2" type="number" value="30" min="5" style="display:none">
<!-- interval-len is used above — this just for layout balance -->
<div style="font-family:'Share Tech Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);padding:8px 0">Uses Interval Length above</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="g-4" id="capacity-results" style="display:none">
<div class="card" style="background:var(--bg-card2)">
<div class="card-title">Effective Agents
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt"><div class="tt-title">Effective Agents</div><div class="tt-formula">Agents × (1 − Shrinkage/100)</div></div>
</span>
</div>
<div class="kpi-val c-cyan" id="cap-effective">—</div>
<div class="kpi-sub">After shrinkage</div>
</div>
<div class="card" style="background:var(--bg-card2)">
<div class="card-title">Calls per Agent
<span class="info-icon" tabindex="0">ⓘ
<div class="tt"><div class="tt-title">Calls per Agent/Interval</div><div class="tt-formula">Interval Secs / AHT</div></div>
</span>
</div>
<div class="kpi-val c-yellow" id="cap-per-agent">—</div>
<div class="kpi-sub">Per interval</div>
